---
import {
  densityModelDefaults,
  elfFromRatio,
  elfShellProfile,
} from '../../../data/part07/energyStressDensityModel.mjs';

const defaults = elfShellProfile();
const width = 720;
const height = 330;
const left = 62;
const right = 680;
const top = 38;
const bottom = 260;
const xMin = -1.5;
const xMax = 1.0;
const xMap = (x) => left + (right - left) * (x - xMin) / (xMax - xMin);
const yMap = (value) => bottom - value * (bottom - top);
const elfPath = defaults.elf.map((value, index) => `${index === 0 ? 'M' : 'L'} ${xMap(defaults.grid[index]).toFixed(2)} ${yMap(value).toFixed(2)}`).join(' ');
const fallbackRows = [0, 1, 3].map((ratio) => ({ ratio, elf: elfFromRatio(ratio) }));
---

<figure class="chapter-visual elf-explorer" data-elf-explorer>
  <figcaption>
    <strong>原创交互模型：ELF 的 bounded mapping 与 shell-boundary minima</strong>
    <span lang="en">Original interactive model: bounded ELF mapping and shell-boundary minima</span>
  </figcaption>

  <div class="chapter-visual__controls elf-explorer__controls">
    <label>
      <span>background χ=t<sub>x</sub>/t<sub>TF</sub></span>
      <input type="range" min="0" max="2.5" step="0.1" value={densityModelDefaults.elf.baselineRatio} data-elf-baseline />
      <output data-elf-baseline-output>{densityModelDefaults.elf.baselineRatio.toFixed(1)}</output>
    </label>
    <label>
      <span>boundary contrast | 边界对比度</span>
      <input type="range" min="0" max="5" step="0.2" value={densityModelDefaults.elf.shellContrast} data-elf-contrast />
      <output data-elf-contrast-output>{densityModelDefaults.elf.shellContrast.toFixed(1)}</output>
    </label>
    <label>
      <span>boundary width | 边界宽度</span>
      <input type="range" min="0.08" max="0.35" step="0.01" value={densityModelDefaults.elf.shellWidth} data-elf-width />
      <output data-elf-width-output>{densityModelDefaults.elf.shellWidth.toFixed(2)}</output>
    </label>
  </div>

  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${width} ${height}`} role="img" aria-labelledby="elf-title elf-desc">
    <title id="elf-title">Electron localization function obtained from an analytic excess-kinetic-energy ratio profile</title>
    <desc id="elf-desc">
      The ratio chi is mapped to ELF equal to one over one plus chi squared. Two analytic peaks in chi produce minima in ELF, illustrating shell-boundary structure without claiming an atomic calculation.
    </desc>
    <line x1={left} y1={bottom} x2={right} y2={bottom} class="plot-axis" />
    <line x1={left} y1={top} x2={left} y2={bottom} class="plot-axis" />
    <line x1={left} y1={yMap(0.5)} x2={right} y2={yMap(0.5)} class="plot-guide" />
    <path d={elfPath} class="plot-curve" data-elf-path />
    {defaults.centers.map((center) => (
      <line x1={xMap(center)} y1={top} x2={xMap(center)} y2={bottom} class="elf-explorer__boundary" />
    ))}
    <text x={right} y="292" text-anchor="end">analytic radial coordinate</text>
    <text x="18" y="50">ELF</text>
    <text x={right - 65} y={yMap(0.5) - 6}>1/2</text>
  </svg>

  <div class="chapter-visual__readout elf-explorer__readout" aria-live="polite">
    <span>background ELF</span><strong data-elf-background>{elfFromRatio(densityModelDefaults.elf.baselineRatio).toFixed(6)}</strong>
    <span>minimum ELF</span><strong data-elf-minimum>{defaults.minimumElf.toFixed(6)}</strong>
    <span>maximum ELF</span><strong data-elf-maximum>{defaults.maximumElf.toFixed(6)}</strong>
    <span>one-orbital limit χ=0</span><strong>1.000000</strong>
    <span>homogeneous reference χ=1</span><strong>0.500000</strong>
  </div>

  <div class="elf-explorer__fallback">
    <p><strong>无 JavaScript 参考表 | No-JavaScript reference table</strong></p>
    <table>
      <thead><tr><th>χ=t_x/t_TF</th><th>ELF</th><th>teaching limit</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        {fallbackRows.map((entry) => (
          <tr>
            <td>{entry.ratio.toFixed(1)}</td>
            <td>{entry.elf.toFixed(6)}</td>
            <td>{entry.ratio === 0 ? 'one occupied spatial orbital in a spin channel' : entry.ratio === 1 ? 'homogeneous-gas normalization' : 'large excess same-spin kinetic density'}</td>
          </tr>
        ))}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <div class="chapter-visual__contract">
    <p><strong>模型：</strong>Martin H.21 的 spin-resolved mapping <code>ELF=[1+χ²]⁻¹</code>，其中 <code>χ=t_x/t_TF</code>。曲线使用两个 analytic Gaussian peaks 构造 χ 的 shell-boundary profile。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Model:</strong> Martin H.21 spin-resolved mapping <code>ELF=[1+χ²]⁻¹</code>, with <code>χ=t_x/t_TF</code>. Two analytic Gaussian peaks construct a shell-boundary profile for χ.</p>
    <p><strong>验收：</strong><code>χ=0→ELF=1</code>；<code>χ=1→ELF=1/2</code>；<code>χ→∞→ELF→0</code>；任何非负 χ 都满足 <code>0&lt;ELF≤1</code>。χ 的 peaks 映射为 ELF minima。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Acceptance:</strong> <code>χ=0→ELF=1</code>, <code>χ=1→ELF=1/2</code>, and <code>χ→∞→ELF→0</code>. Every nonnegative χ gives <code>0&lt;ELF≤1</code>, and peaks of χ map to minima of ELF.</p>
    <p><strong>边界：</strong>该 profile 不是 Ne、Ar、分子或材料计算。ELF 是 same-spin excess kinetic descriptor；最大值或 basin 不能单独证明唯一键型、电子对、氧化态、拓扑分类或实验可观测量。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Boundary:</strong> the profile is not a calculation for Ne, Ar, a molecule, or a material. ELF is a same-spin excess-kinetic descriptor. A maximum or basin alone does not establish a unique bond type, electron pair, oxidation state, topological class, or experimental observable.</p>
  </div>
</figure>

<script>
  import { elfFromRatio, elfShellProfile } from '../../../data/part07/energyStressDensityModel.mjs';

  document.querySelectorAll('[data-elf-explorer]').forEach((root) => {
    const baseline = root.querySelector('[data-elf-baseline]');
    const contrast = root.querySelector('[data-elf-contrast]');
    const widthInput = root.querySelector('[data-elf-width]');
    if (!(baseline instanceof HTMLInputElement) || !(contrast instanceof HTMLInputElement) || !(widthInput instanceof HTMLInputElement)) return;
    const path = root.querySelector('[data-elf-path]');
    const outputs = {
      baseline: root.querySelector('[data-elf-baseline-output]'), contrast: root.querySelector('[data-elf-contrast-output]'), width: root.querySelector('[data-elf-width-output]'), background: root.querySelector('[data-elf-background]'), minimum: root.querySelector('[data-elf-minimum]'), maximum: root.querySelector('[data-elf-maximum]'),
    };
    const left = 62; const right = 680; const top = 38; const bottom = 260; const xMin = -1.5; const xMax = 1.0;
    const xMap = (x) => left + (right - left) * (x - xMin) / (xMax - xMin);
    const yMap = (value) => bottom - value * (bottom - top);
    const update = () => {
      const baselineRatio = Number(baseline.value);
      const shellContrast = Number(contrast.value);
      const shellWidth = Number(widthInput.value);
      const result = elfShellProfile({ baselineRatio, shellContrast, shellWidth });
      const curve = result.elf.map((value, index) => `${index === 0 ? 'M' : 'L'} ${xMap(result.grid[index]).toFixed(2)} ${yMap(value).toFixed(2)}`).join(' ');
      if (path instanceof SVGPathElement) path.setAttribute('d', curve);
      if (outputs.baseline instanceof HTMLOutputElement) outputs.baseline.value = baselineRatio.toFixed(1);
      if (outputs.contrast instanceof HTMLOutputElement) outputs.contrast.value = shellContrast.toFixed(1);
      if (outputs.width instanceof HTMLOutputElement) outputs.width.value = shellWidth.toFixed(2);
      if (outputs.background instanceof HTMLElement) outputs.background.textContent = elfFromRatio(baselineRatio).toFixed(6);
      if (outputs.minimum instanceof HTMLElement) outputs.minimum.textContent = result.minimumElf.toFixed(6);
      if (outputs.maximum instanceof HTMLElement) outputs.maximum.textContent = result.maximumElf.toFixed(6);
    };
    [baseline, contrast, widthInput].forEach((input) => input.addEventListener('input', update));
    update();
  });
</script>

<style>
  .elf-explorer { overflow-x: auto; }
  .elf-explorer svg { width: 100%; min-width: 42rem; }
  .elf-explorer text { fill: currentColor; font-size: 13px; }
  .elf-explorer__boundary { stroke: var(--sl-color-gray-3); stroke-width: 1.2; stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .elf-explorer__controls { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(12rem, 1fr)); gap: 0.8rem; }
  .elf-explorer__controls label { display: grid; gap: 0.3rem; }
  .elf-explorer__readout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(10rem, 1fr)); gap: 0.4rem 1rem; }
  .elf-explorer__fallback { max-width: 48rem; }
</style>
